---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="关于我们">
  <article class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
        <span class="text-3xl">📦</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary dark:text-[#E5E6EB] mb-3">关于资源分享博客</h1>
      <p class="text-text-muted dark:text-[#666666]">分享优质资源，助力学习成长</p>
    </div>
    
    <!-- 网站介绍 -->
    <section class="bg-surface-card dark:bg-[#1E1E1E] rounded-card border border-surface-border dark:border-[#333333] p-6 mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary dark:text-[#E5E6EB] mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>🎯</span>
        <span>网站介绍</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-text-secondary dark:text-[#A6A6A6] leading-relaxed">
        资源分享博客致力于收集和分享各类优质资源，包括绿化软件、影视动漫、PC工具、游戏资源和实用教程。我们相信知识和资源应该自由共享，帮助更多人提升自己，实现个人成长和价值。
      </p>
    </section>
    
    <!-- 资源分类 -->
    <section class="bg-surface-card dark:bg-[#1E1E1E] rounded-card border border-surface-border dark:border-[#333333] p-6 mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary dark:text-[#E5E6EB] mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>📁</span>
        <span>资源分类</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
        <div class="bg-surface-border dark:bg-[#333333] rounded-lg p-4">
          <div class="text-xl mb-2">💻</div>
          <div class="font-medium text-text-primary dark:text-[#E5E6EB] text-sm">绿化软件</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-text-muted dark:text-[#666666]">免安装软件</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-border dark:bg-[#333333] rounded-lg p-4">
          <div class="text-xl mb-2">🎬</div>
          <div class="font-medium text-text-primary dark:text-[#E5E6EB] text-sm">影视动漫</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-text-muted dark:text-[#666666]">高清影视</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-border dark:bg-[#333333] rounded-lg p-4">
          <div class="text-xl mb-2">🛠️</div>
          <div class="font-medium text-text-primary dark:text-[#E5E6EB] text-sm">PC工具</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-text-muted dark:text-[#666666]">实用工具</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-border dark:bg-[#333333] rounded-lg p-4">
          <div class="text-xl mb-2">🎮</div>
          <div class="font-medium text-text-primary dark:text-[#E5E6EB] text-sm">游戏相关</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-text-muted dark:text-[#666666]">游戏资源</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-border dark:bg-[#333333] rounded-lg p-4">
          <div class="text-xl mb-2">📚</div>
          <div class="font-medium text-text-primary dark:text-[#E5E6EB] text-sm">实用教程</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-text-muted dark:text-[#666666]">学习教程</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-border dark:bg-[#333333] rounded-lg p-4">
          <div class="text-xl mb-2">🔗</div>
          <div class="font-medium text-text-primary dark:text-[#E5E6EB] text-sm">外站导航</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-text-muted dark:text-[#666666]">优质网站</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    
    <!-- 免责声明 -->
    <section class="bg-surface-card dark:bg-[#1E1E1E] rounded-card border border-surface-border dark:border-[#333333] p-6 mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary dark:text-[#E5E6EB] mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>⚠️</span>
        <span>免责声明</span>
      </h2>
      <ul class="text-text-secondary dark:text-[#A6A6A6] space-y-2">
        <li>• 本站资源均来自互联网，仅供学习交流使用</li>
        <li>• 请勿将资源用于商业用途</li>
        <li>• 下载后请在24小时内删除</li>
        <li>• 如有侵权请联系我们删除</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    
    <!-- 联系方式 -->
    <section class="bg-surface-card dark:bg-[#1E1E1E] rounded-card border border-surface-border dark:border-[#333333] p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary dark:text-[#E5E6EB] mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>📧</span>
        <span>联系我们</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-text-secondary dark:text-[#A6A6A6] mb-4">
        如有任何问题或建议，欢迎通过以下方式联系我们：
      </p>
      <div class="flex gap-3">
        <a href="mailto:contact@example.com" class="btn bg-primary text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors">
          发送邮件
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>